{"title": "发布门禁看板", "description": "把 8 项发布门禁做成看板：绿=可本轮闭环，红=需外部材料/工具/签署。请选择发布口径（A 全量合规 / B 降级表述 / C 推迟），并填写各项责任方，提交后我据此重排修复计划。", "html": "<div class="wrap">
  <div class="hd">
    <div class="hd-t">发布门禁看板 · v0.1</div>
    <div class="hd-s">判断：NO-GO（8 门中 2 项可本轮闭合）</div>
  </div>

  <div class="gates" id="gates"></div>

  <div class="sec-t">发布口径</div>
  <div class="tracks" id="tracks">
    <label class="tk" data-v="A"><b>A 全量合规版</b><span>需压测报告 + SLA 条款；可直述"已验证"，周期最长</span></label>
    <label class="tk" data-v="B"><b>B 降级表述版</b><span>容量写"验证计划+待验证"；仍须满足 PDF/页数/审批</span></label>
    <label class="tk" data-v="C"><b>C 推迟发布</b><span>待证据齐备再排期，放弃 2026-12-05 窗口</span></label>
  </div>

  <div class="ft">
    <span id="hint">请选择口径并填写责任方</span>
    <button id="go">提交</button>
  </div>
</div>
<style>
  .wrap{font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;color:var(--dsw-alias-label-primary,#1b1b1f);font-size:13px}
  .hd{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;padding-bottom:10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--dsw-alias-border-secondary,#e6e6ea)}
  .hd-t{font-weight:650;font-size:14px}
  .hd-s{font-size:12px;color:var(--dsw-alias-label-danger,#c0392b);font-weight:600}
  .gates{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(250px,1fr));gap:8px;margin:12px 0}
  .g{border:1px solid var(--dsw-alias-border-secondary,#e6e6ea);border-radius:8px;padding:9px 10px;background:var(--dsw-alias-bg-secondary,#fafafb)}
  .g.red{border-left:3px solid var(--dsw-alias-label-danger,#c0392b)}
  .g.yel{border-left:3px solid #d39e00}
  .g.grn{border-left:3px solid #1f8a4c}
  .g-t{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:6px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:4px}
  .g-t em{font-style:normal;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;color:var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary,#6b6b73)}
  .g-c{font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary,#55555c);margin-bottom:6px}
  .g input{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;font:inherit;font-size:11.5px;padding:3px 6px;border-radius:5px;border:1px solid var(--dsw-alias-border-secondary,#dcdce0);background:var(--dsw-alias-bg-primary,#fff);color:inherit}
  .badge{font-size:10.5px;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:99px;white-space:nowrap}
  .b-red{background:rgba(192,57,43,.12);color:#c0392b}
  .b-yel{background:rgba(211,158,0,.15);color:#8a6d00}
  .b-grn{background:rgba(31,138,76,.13);color:#1f8a4c}
  .sec-t{font-weight:650;margin:14px 0 8px;font-size:13px}
  .tracks{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(210px,1fr));gap:8px}
  .tk{display:block;border:1px solid var(--dsw-alias-border-secondary,#e6e6ea);border-radius:8px;padding:10px;cursor:pointer;background:var(--dsw-alias-bg-secondary,#fafafb)}
  .tk b{display:block;font-size:12.5px;margin-bottom:3px}
  .tk span{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary,#66666e);line-height:1.45}
  .tk.on{border-color:var(--dsw-alias-label-highlight,#2f6feb);box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--dsw-alias-label-highlight,#2f6feb) inset}
  .ft{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:14px;padding-top:10px;border-top:1px solid var(--dsw-alias-border-secondary,#e6e6ea)}
  #hint{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary,#6b6b73)}
  #go{font:inherit;font-weight:600;padding:6px 16px;border-radius:6px;border:none;cursor:pointer;background:var(--dsw-alias-label-highlight,#2f6feb);color:#fff}
  #go:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:not-allowed}
</style>
<script>
const G=[
 {id:"G1",n:"15,000 容量证据",c:"无压测报告；退出=取得报告或书面降级为验证计划+待验证",s:"red",o:"测试负责人"},
 {id:"G2",n:"PDF 输出与可检索",c:"产品仅 Markdown/DOCX；退出=PDF 实现或书面偏离获确认",s:"red",o:"研发/商务"},
 {id:"G3",n:"数字口径冲突",c:"10,000 与 15,000、99.5% 与 99.9% 并存；本轮可统一",s:"grn",o:"方案编制"},
 {id:"G4",n:"99.9% 可用性依据",c:"无条款/实测；本轮可降级为设计目标+证据路径",s:"yel",o:"商务/法务"},
 {id:"G5",n:"关键章节覆盖",c:"第 2/4/6/7/8 章无正文；SUB 系列 10 条 P0 全未闭环",s:"red",o:"方案编制"},
 {id:"G6",n:"80 页与格式门禁",c:"未执行页码统计；预算恰好 80 页且零余量",s:"red",o:"编制/排版"},
 {id:"G7",n:"用词与证据登记",c:"禁用主张扫描未跑；证据登记表本轮可建",s:"yel",o:"合规审核"},
 {id:"G8",n:"审批与生成元数据",c:"无签署、无模型版本记录；须人工完成",s:"red",o:"管理层"}
];
const cls={red:"b-red",yel:"b-yel",grn:"b-grn"},txt={red:"需外部",yel:"部分可",grn:"本轮可"};
const el=document.getElementById("gates");
G.forEach(g=>{
  const d=document.createElement("div");
  d.className="g "+g.s;
  d.innerHTML='<div class="g-t"><span>'+g.id+"　"+g.n+'</span><em class="badge '+cls[g.s]+'">'+txt[g.s]+'</em></div><div class="g-c">'+g.c+'</div><input data-id="'+g.id+'" value="'+g.o+'" placeholder="责任方">';
  el.appendChild(d);
});
let track=null;
document.querySelectorAll(".tk").forEach(t=>t.addEventListener("click",()=>{
  document.querySelectorAll(".tk").forEach(x=>x.classList.remove("on"));
  t.classList.add("on");track=t.dataset.v;chk();
}));
const chk=()=>{document.getElementById("go").disabled=!track;document.getElementById("hint").textContent=track?"已选口径 "+track+"，可提交":"请选择口径并填写责任方";};
document.getElementById("go").addEventListener("click",()=>{
  const owners={};document.querySelectorAll("#gates input").forEach(i=>owners[i.dataset.id]=i.value.trim());
  window.dsh.emit("release_decision",{track,owners});
  document.getElementById("hint").textContent="已提交，等待重排计划";
});
chk();
</script>", "interaction_hint": "选择 A/B/C 口径并核对 8 项责任方后点「提交」"}

